                    "words, what it says to do. Never ask the person for the code or any token.")
AI_LEGACY_NOTE = (f"{SIGN_IN_NOTE}: this computer's datastash connector still uses its older sign-in, which keeps "
                  "working for now. The plugin itself has shown the person a link and code for the new sign-in; there is "
